格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Connect AI agent sessions on one machine — a DeepSeek Harness plugin for session-to-session collaboration, with lifecycle support to wake finished sessions and loop-safe messaging budgets.","id":"gh:1352521647","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-s2s","slug":"ashuai/dsh-s2s","topics":["dsh-plugin","dsh-plugins"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Connect AI agent sessions on one machine — a DeepSeek Harness plugin for session-to-session collabor"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ation, with lifecycle support to wake finished sessions and loop-safe messaging budgets."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-s2s — DeepSeek Harness 的 Session-to-Session 同宿主会话互联"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> 一个 cordis 插件,让**同一台宿主上的多个 DSH session 互相对话**——按**会话名(标题)**点名即可,并支持**拉起已结束(静止)的 session**。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**实现思路受 a2a 启发,但并非其 fork**:a2a 是跨主机 mesh(hub + WebSocket + presence);而 s2s 是**同宿主单进程**路径,因此**不继承其 hu"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"b/网络层**,只借鉴了它的**注入习语**(空闲→`followup`、忙碌→`inject`)。s2s 用一个**进程内 broker** 直接投递,**零 TCP 端口、零 WS、零重连**。原"},{"id":"p4s3","text":" a2a 版实现归档在本仓库历史与 `legacy-a2a` 分支,作参照。(跨进程/跨机 mesh 请直接用 a2a;非 DSH 标准 A2A agent 需网关类插件。)"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> 使用手册见 USAGE.md;场景与最佳实践见 docs/BEST_PRACTICES.md;设计证据稿见 docs/SOLUTION.md(v0.2 历史基线)。"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 它是什么 / 不是什么"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"| | s2s(本项目) | a2a |"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"| 拓扑 | **同宿主/单进程** | 跨进程/跨机(可信局域网) |\n| 传输 | **进程内 broker 直投,零端口** | hub server + WebSocket |\n| 寻址 | "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"**name(标题)主寻址,现读不缓存** | roster / presence |\n| 静止会话 | ✅ 按名**拉起**(`AgentRegistry.resume`)(a2a 没有) | ❌ "},{"id":"p8s3","text":"仅在线接收方 |\n| 防回环 | ✅ 发送侧 hop/限速 | ❌ |\n| 浏览器 UI / 命令面 | ❌ 无(精简) | ✅ |"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 功能一览"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **进程内投递**:`S2sBroker.deliver(sessionId, {from,text})` → `ctx.agents.get(...)` → `agent.followup`(空"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"闲)/`inject`(忙碌)。零网络、零序列化。\n- **name 主寻址**:`s2s_resume(name: \"开发\", ...)` / `s2s_message(name: \"产品\", .."},{"id":"p10s3","text":".)`;标题取自**宿主的零 I/O 投影缓存**(本插件不另存标题缓存),因此**改名在下一个标题检查点后生效**,而非同一瞬间;同名→`ambiguous`(用 `session_id` 消歧),"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"查无→`not-found`+候选。\n- **拉起静止会话**:入信箱 → `autoResume=allow` 时 `AgentRegistry.resume` 拉起 → 投递;拉起的会话保留 li"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ve-idle(不自动归眠)。\n- **6 个模型工具**:`s2s_peers`(本项目 live)/ `s2s_sessions`(本项目 标题+三态;`all=true` 全量)/ `s2s_m"},{"id":"p10s6","text":"essage`(发/唤醒)/ `s2s_resume`(显式唤醒)/ `s2s_history`(进程作用域历史)/ `s2s_schedule`(会话内定时注入)。\n- **持久信箱**:`~/.d"},{"id":"p10s7","text":"sh/s2s/mailboxes/<sessionId>/*.json`,原子写、时序命名、损坏自愈。\n- **按需加载**:`lifecycle`/`budget` 配置块缺席即不挂载;broker"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"/discovery/tools 恒挂(核心)。"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> 详细用法见 USAGE.md。"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## 挂载"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"装**新**插件必须用 **`- insert:`** 形式,且 `name` 指向可解析的 ESM 入口(不能是目录):"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"零端口:无需配 hub/server(那已是跨机 a2a 的事)。"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 路线图"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- ✅ **进程内重构(R1)**:去掉 hub/WS 网络层,`S2sBroker` 进程内直投;零端口。\n- ✅ **name 主寻址(R2)**:按会话标题点名,现读不缓存;同名/查无显式处理。"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"\n- ✅ **静态会话拉起(R2)**:`AgentRegistry.resume` 拉起 + 信箱 + drain + 防双开。\n- ✅ **预算(R3 部分)**:发送侧 hop/限速。\n- ✅ "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"**会话内定时唤醒(R4)**:`s2s_schedule`(每 N / 定点拉起,到点 idle 才注入 / busy 推后 / dormant 交 s2s)。设计见 docs/SCHEDULE.m"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"d。\n- 🔲 **待做**:`s2s-etiquette` skill(何时找谁、礼节与汇报规范)。\n- 🔲 **待做**:历史/信箱持久化强度调优;真实 GUI 端到端体验。\n- 🔲 **可选项**"},{"id":"p17s5","text":":与外部标准 A2A agent 互通(需独立网关,本包不做)。"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## 开发"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"MIT。"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
